WEBVTT

01:37.520 --> 01:42.910
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.729 --> 01:45.990
[Episode 9]

01:46.950 --> 01:48.350
Careful, Your Lordship—

01:48.470 --> 01:49.430
one wrong move,

01:50.120 --> 01:51.450
and the hand on the blade

01:51.680 --> 01:53.280
could be the one that bleeds.

01:54.680 --> 01:56.150
The more they resist...

01:57.750 --> 01:59.000
the more I enjoy it.

02:15.120 --> 02:15.680
Drink it.

02:16.190 --> 02:17.520
Don't let it go to waste.

02:38.240 --> 02:39.770
I was rash and rude just now.

02:47.150 --> 02:48.520
I'd had quite a fright,

02:49.030 --> 02:50.760
which is why I reacted that way.

03:03.520 --> 03:05.240
Your Lordship is magnanimous.

03:05.240 --> 03:07.240
Surely you won't hold it against me.

03:07.280 --> 03:09.210
The way you put it, Fourth Lady Xie,

03:09.280 --> 03:11.810
makes it seem
as if I brought this upon myself.

03:12.190 --> 03:12.720
Drink it.

03:35.750 --> 03:36.960
I'm really worried

03:37.030 --> 03:38.800
she might get caught up in this.

03:40.630 --> 03:41.710
That poor child

03:42.190 --> 03:43.790
has suffered from a young age

03:44.000 --> 03:46.200
and has hardly known a day of happiness.

03:46.910 --> 03:48.430
I'm just an old woman.

03:48.870 --> 03:51.210
All I want is for her to be safe

03:51.230 --> 03:53.000
and healthy.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.710
Granny,

04:07.080 --> 04:08.210
if you have anything

04:08.430 --> 04:09.690
you want to give Yunya,

04:10.080 --> 04:11.540
I'll take it to her for you.

04:13.030 --> 04:13.750
Really?

04:17.000 --> 04:17.829
Alright.

04:18.000 --> 04:18.800
That's great.

04:26.310 --> 04:27.830
Once spring comes,

04:28.070 --> 04:29.870
the city is full of willow fluff.

04:30.070 --> 04:31.920
She's been prone to
coughing since she was little

04:31.920 --> 04:34.950
and loves my salted kumquats the most.

04:36.680 --> 04:38.000
And the yam cake.

04:38.830 --> 04:40.430
I didn't put much honey in it.

04:40.720 --> 04:41.920
I was afraid it'd be too sweet

04:41.920 --> 04:43.320
and irritate her throat.

04:43.830 --> 04:44.680
Ever since she was little,

04:44.680 --> 04:47.240
that child has never known
when to stop eating.

04:47.240 --> 04:48.950
If you happen to see her,

04:49.310 --> 04:51.630
please remind her a few more times for me.

04:52.150 --> 04:52.630
Okay.

04:52.950 --> 04:54.210
I'll keep that in mind.

04:55.630 --> 04:56.680
Oh!

04:56.920 --> 04:59.480
There are also several jars
of fritillaria syrup.

04:59.480 --> 05:00.270
I made it

05:00.430 --> 05:02.950
by simmering the fritillaria

05:02.950 --> 05:03.920
in melted snow.

05:04.240 --> 05:05.870
Works wonders for coughs.

05:10.240 --> 05:12.850
Are these too much for you to carry?

05:13.240 --> 05:13.840
Not at all.

05:14.510 --> 05:15.560
Whatever you'd like to send,

05:15.560 --> 05:16.560
just give it to me.

05:18.830 --> 05:20.560
I'll go fetch them from inside.

05:20.800 --> 05:21.860
Oh, right, Granny.

05:22.800 --> 05:24.430
I'll take all those loquat candies

05:24.430 --> 05:25.560
you just mentioned.

05:27.480 --> 05:29.000
Can you finish them all?

05:29.870 --> 05:31.430
I'll share them with my men.

05:31.750 --> 05:34.409
They've been dying to
try your cooking for ages.

06:10.680 --> 06:12.010
It's fine, Eldest Lady.

06:12.600 --> 06:13.310
Don't worry.

06:13.310 --> 06:14.170
Eldest Sister.

06:15.560 --> 06:16.420
Fourth Sister.

06:18.070 --> 06:18.800
Are you okay?

06:18.830 --> 06:19.490
How are you?

06:19.800 --> 06:21.190
Don't worry, Eldest Sister.

06:21.190 --> 06:22.310
I'm not hurt at all.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.280
The nanny who went with you

06:23.280 --> 06:25.040
to make the bed earlier came back

06:25.040 --> 06:27.430
and told us Lord Yan kept you there
for a medicinal meal—

06:27.430 --> 06:30.030
it frightened Eldest Lady and me
half to death.

06:31.360 --> 06:33.420
He didn't give you a hard time, did he?

06:33.510 --> 06:34.430
He...

06:35.750 --> 06:36.870
didn't.

06:39.190 --> 06:40.240
That's good.

06:40.870 --> 06:44.000
It's just that in the past,
Lord Yan was only after money.

06:44.150 --> 06:46.750
Why has he made
such a huge commotion this time?

06:47.800 --> 06:49.200
Everyone knows Zhengjun

06:49.390 --> 06:51.320
can't even use an abacus properly.

06:52.040 --> 06:54.950
How could he possibly have orchestrated
the swap of the relief grain?

06:54.950 --> 06:56.000
What Yan Rui wants

06:56.600 --> 06:58.260
isn't the real culprit at all.

06:59.480 --> 07:00.340
Your Lordship!

07:02.720 --> 07:03.580
Your Lordship.

07:05.070 --> 07:07.400
Xie Zhengjun has been taken into custody.

07:07.870 --> 07:08.430
Good.

07:09.190 --> 07:11.850
Send a letter to
the patriarch of the Xie family.

07:12.070 --> 07:13.870
Wouldn't want the long distance

07:14.040 --> 07:15.640
to keep him from news of home.

07:16.920 --> 07:17.720
Understood.

07:21.620 --> 07:22.780
[Qinyue Corridor]

07:26.430 --> 07:27.950
In this entire household,

07:27.950 --> 07:30.430
Eldest Lady is the only one
who genuinely cares about you.

07:30.430 --> 07:32.430
She came rushing over to find me just now,

07:32.430 --> 07:34.560
wanting to go with me to bring you back.

07:34.600 --> 07:35.200
Qingyuan!

07:36.280 --> 07:38.510
[Fuyu Pavilion]

07:37.950 --> 07:38.750
Second Madam.

07:38.870 --> 07:39.560
Qingyuan,

07:40.000 --> 07:43.070
you're the most capable and
resourceful person in this household.

07:43.070 --> 07:44.950
Given your relationship with Lord Yan,

07:44.950 --> 07:47.040
surely you can put in a word this time,

07:47.040 --> 07:47.630
right?

07:48.830 --> 07:49.270
You...

07:49.630 --> 07:51.560
you must help your second brother.

07:51.680 --> 07:53.310
Your second brother has never dared to

07:53.310 --> 07:55.120
harm so much as an ant his whole life.

07:55.120 --> 07:57.950
He could never have murdered someone to
cover his tracks or swapped the grain.

07:57.950 --> 07:59.600
He has truly been framed.

08:00.870 --> 08:01.680
Second Madam,

08:02.190 --> 08:04.250
it's not that I don't want to save him.

08:04.310 --> 08:05.110
It's just that

08:05.600 --> 08:08.600
this matter concerns
the future of the entire family.

08:08.720 --> 08:10.980
It can't be settled with just a few words.

08:11.310 --> 08:14.000
Moreover, the Criminal Justice Office has

08:14.120 --> 08:15.360
some pretty formidable methods.

08:15.360 --> 08:18.510
They can make a man swear that his ancestors
for 8 generations were all rebels.

08:18.510 --> 08:20.120
With Second Brother's personality,

08:20.120 --> 08:23.050
how many rounds of torture
could he possibly endure?

08:24.680 --> 08:25.310
They're...

08:25.310 --> 08:26.320
They're that ruthless?

08:26.320 --> 08:30.750
[Fuyu Pavilion]

08:26.720 --> 08:27.600
Yeah.

08:27.750 --> 08:29.190
Perhaps in a few days,

08:29.390 --> 08:30.870
Second Brother will confess on his own

08:30.870 --> 08:32.630
that he was the one
who brought disaster upon the family.

08:32.630 --> 08:34.120
By then, even if I

08:34.120 --> 08:35.630
plead with every kind word I can think of,

08:35.630 --> 08:37.890
how could that possibly resolve things?

08:38.630 --> 08:39.240
Well...

08:45.240 --> 08:46.040
Second Madam,

08:47.360 --> 08:49.560
when my mother was alive, she often said

08:49.840 --> 08:51.320
that those who frame someone

08:51.320 --> 08:54.250
know better than anyone
that the person is innocent.

08:56.550 --> 08:57.440
Surely

08:57.910 --> 09:00.240
you of all people understand that.

09:00.630 --> 09:03.510
Unless Lord Yan is willing to
back down of his own accord,

09:03.510 --> 09:04.390
there's

09:05.120 --> 09:06.630
no way out.

09:09.670 --> 09:10.510
Qingyuan,

09:10.600 --> 09:11.030
you...

09:15.030 --> 09:16.200
You little brat,

09:16.600 --> 09:18.600
you think I can't deal with you?

09:22.640 --> 09:28.680
[Zhongwu Hall]

09:23.320 --> 09:25.670
The Xie family's waters

09:26.000 --> 09:29.080
run deep enough to drown a dozen censors.

09:29.510 --> 09:31.550
How many times have I told you?

09:31.550 --> 09:32.680
Don't you remember?

09:33.720 --> 09:35.390
Have a few good meals gone to your head

09:35.390 --> 09:36.910
and made you forget everything?

09:36.910 --> 09:39.370
Why did you have to
stick your nose into that?

09:39.670 --> 09:40.480
Father,

09:40.960 --> 09:42.870
everyone in Hengtang knows

09:42.960 --> 09:44.630
the character
of the Xie family's second son.

09:44.630 --> 09:46.600
There's no way
he had the brains or the nerve

09:46.600 --> 09:47.840
to mastermind the grain swap.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.080
It's obviously a setup.

09:49.080 --> 09:50.030
Exactly.

09:50.720 --> 09:53.150
The officialdom in Hengtang is a mess.

09:53.720 --> 09:56.420
None of those people have clean hands.

09:56.630 --> 09:59.000
Even if they didn't do
that particular thing,

09:59.000 --> 10:00.440
they're still entangled in it.

10:00.440 --> 10:02.270
Either way, he's a dead man!

10:02.600 --> 10:04.260
Why should you care about him?

10:04.270 --> 10:05.870
What if I marry Xie Qingyuan?

10:06.840 --> 10:08.480
Then our family and the Xie family

10:08.480 --> 10:09.410
will be in-laws.

10:09.550 --> 10:12.010
Would you still stand by
and do nothing then?

10:13.000 --> 10:15.130
Have you been bewitched by some vixen?

10:16.790 --> 10:19.240
You've only met that girl a few times,

10:19.790 --> 10:21.590
and already you're lovestruck?

10:22.030 --> 10:23.230
Let me tell you again—

10:23.750 --> 10:25.750
the Xie family's fourth daughter isn't

10:25.750 --> 10:28.150
someone you can marry
just because you want to!

10:28.150 --> 10:28.750
Yeah!

10:28.750 --> 10:31.270
I might not know her, but I know you!

10:31.480 --> 10:32.440
I've watched

10:32.440 --> 10:34.270
you grow up.

10:34.270 --> 10:35.960
I know what kind of woman

10:35.960 --> 10:37.960
will make you thrive and what kind

10:38.750 --> 10:40.270
will ruin you.

10:43.080 --> 10:44.680
Let me ask you one more thing—

10:45.750 --> 10:48.240
have you asked
the Xie family's opinion on this?

10:48.240 --> 10:49.360
Then I'll send someone right now

10:49.360 --> 10:50.670
to propose marriage with betrothal gifts!

10:50.670 --> 10:51.630
I'll kick you to death!

10:51.630 --> 10:53.240
I... I...

10:51.860 --> 10:53.660
[Zhongwu Hall]

11:02.200 --> 11:03.000
Father,

11:03.320 --> 11:04.910
weren't you like me
when you courted Mother,

11:04.910 --> 11:06.480
pestering her relentlessly?

11:06.480 --> 11:07.440
Why can't you believe

11:07.440 --> 11:09.080
my feelings are just as sincere?

11:09.080 --> 11:09.870
Right, Mother?

11:09.870 --> 11:10.270
You...

11:13.240 --> 11:15.030
Your mother is different from other women!

11:15.030 --> 11:17.120
Your mother is
the finest woman under heaven,

11:17.120 --> 11:18.750
and I married her!

11:33.390 --> 11:35.510
You need to remember what I told you.

11:38.870 --> 11:40.480
You actually kicked him!

11:40.600 --> 11:41.510
Scaring him would have been enough!

11:41.510 --> 11:42.390
Why did you really kick him...

11:41.550 --> 11:44.150
[Zhongwu Hall]

11:42.510 --> 11:43.910
You actually kicked him!

11:55.630 --> 11:56.870
There is something

11:57.600 --> 11:59.000
I'm not sure I should say.

11:59.630 --> 12:01.760
When Yan Rui came to the Xie residence,

12:02.630 --> 12:04.270
he was after the ledger.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.970
W-What did you say? The ledger?

12:08.790 --> 12:11.190
Wasn't the ledger
washed away by the river?

12:14.510 --> 12:15.270
Brother,

12:15.630 --> 12:17.320
I lied to you.

12:17.630 --> 12:19.740
That night when the estate manager died,

12:19.740 --> 12:21.800
the ledger never fell into the river.

12:21.960 --> 12:23.960
I hid it away.

12:24.720 --> 12:27.270
I just wanted to
leave a way out for myself.

12:27.510 --> 12:29.440
I've never wavered
in my loyalty to you, Brother.

12:29.440 --> 12:31.510
So you lied

12:31.840 --> 12:33.770
and said the ledger was washed away

12:33.870 --> 12:34.600
by the river?

12:36.960 --> 12:37.720
Well...

12:38.440 --> 12:38.910
Brother...

12:38.910 --> 12:40.320
You brat,

12:40.910 --> 12:42.440
playing games with me, huh?

12:43.080 --> 12:44.870
I'll kill you, you brat.

12:44.910 --> 12:46.150
Punish yourself with a drink!

12:46.150 --> 12:47.550
I'll drink. I'll drink.

12:53.030 --> 12:53.630
Brother,

12:53.630 --> 12:55.390
doesn't the Xie family's second son

12:55.390 --> 12:57.250
enjoy admiring that painting...

12:57.720 --> 13:00.500
the Spring Mountain Night Gathering?

13:00.720 --> 13:03.030
So I secretly hid the ledger in it

13:03.030 --> 13:04.690
and had him keep it safe for me.

13:06.200 --> 13:08.630
But I never expected that
a couple of days ago, his mother

13:08.630 --> 13:09.440
took it away.

13:11.720 --> 13:13.550
You've grown some nerve, huh?

13:13.790 --> 13:16.440
Enough to frame a woman
and let her take the fall?

13:16.440 --> 13:17.750
I wouldn't dare, Brother.

13:17.750 --> 13:19.200
I only meant to

13:19.200 --> 13:20.720
quietly hide it away.

13:21.270 --> 13:23.200
I just didn't see this snag coming,

13:23.200 --> 13:23.910
you see.

13:23.910 --> 13:27.030
Then why don't you
just get the ledger back?

13:28.360 --> 13:29.670
I can't.

13:31.030 --> 13:32.360
Xie Zhengjun said

13:32.910 --> 13:34.870
his mother burned the ledger.

13:35.000 --> 13:36.260
As if I'd believe that.

13:37.080 --> 13:38.910
Y-Yan Rui

13:39.270 --> 13:40.870
is an absolute bastard!

13:41.360 --> 13:43.750
All those rumors about him
and Fourth Lady Xie and whatever else—

13:43.750 --> 13:46.150
he's really just trying to investigate us!

13:46.600 --> 13:47.550
And... And...

13:47.550 --> 13:49.240
And the Xie family's second son too—

13:49.240 --> 13:50.600
he can't be trusted either.

13:50.600 --> 13:52.630
He'll give us up sooner or later.

13:53.150 --> 13:53.840
Brother,

13:54.600 --> 13:55.870
we need to plan ahead.

13:57.240 --> 13:58.030
I know.

14:02.030 --> 14:02.910
Brother,

14:03.480 --> 14:04.440
I...

14:07.440 --> 14:09.080
I was nobody before.

14:10.120 --> 14:11.630
Just a lowly fishmonger

14:12.150 --> 14:13.680
with nothing to eat or wear,

14:13.910 --> 14:16.030
and my whole family was
nearly starving to death.

14:16.030 --> 14:17.230
If it weren't for you,

14:17.720 --> 14:19.120
I wouldn't be here today.

14:19.270 --> 14:21.510
Look at me now—decked in gold and silver,

14:21.510 --> 14:23.510
feasting on the finest delicacies.

14:23.510 --> 14:26.480
I followed you
from that small fishing village

14:26.910 --> 14:28.120
to Hengtang.

14:29.870 --> 14:30.670
I still hope

14:31.240 --> 14:32.770
to go to the capital with you

14:33.630 --> 14:34.480
one day.

14:41.600 --> 14:42.360
Brother...

14:44.870 --> 14:45.840
I've failed you.

14:48.120 --> 14:49.030
Baofeng.

14:49.600 --> 14:50.270
Brother!

14:50.480 --> 14:51.540
What are you doing?

14:52.000 --> 14:54.320
I owe you my life, Brother.

14:54.600 --> 14:55.930
But I ruined everything

14:56.150 --> 14:57.270
with the ledger.

14:57.670 --> 15:00.120
My life is worthless.

15:00.600 --> 15:02.930
I'm just afraid
I'll drag you down with me.

15:18.950 --> 15:19.950
[Xie Zhengjun also
shared in the illicit proceeds.]

15:19.950 --> 15:20.950
[Substituted old, moldy rice
for the court's fresh relief grain.]

15:26.490 --> 15:27.490
[Xie Zhengjun also
shared in the illicit proceeds.]

15:27.490 --> 15:28.620
[Substituted old, moldy rice
for the court's disaster relief grain.]

15:34.470 --> 15:37.740
[Guilty subject, Guo Baofeng]

15:42.030 --> 15:42.960
Baofeng,

15:47.720 --> 15:49.120
I've sent this year's

15:50.550 --> 15:52.410
share of the profits to your wife.

16:04.440 --> 16:05.200
My Lord.

16:06.030 --> 16:08.510
Everyone in your household, young and old,

16:10.150 --> 16:12.000
is taken care of.

16:13.750 --> 16:14.720
Baofeng,

16:16.840 --> 16:18.120
you can

16:19.240 --> 16:20.550
go in peace.

16:44.240 --> 16:45.200
Lord Wei?

16:46.000 --> 16:46.630
Lord Wei,

16:46.960 --> 16:48.360
I really didn't kill him.

16:48.390 --> 16:50.790
G-Guo Baofeng was
already dead when I got there.

16:50.790 --> 16:51.650
My good nephew,

16:51.910 --> 16:53.030
I know all that.

16:54.630 --> 16:55.630
Listen to me.

16:56.550 --> 16:58.030
At this point, you have no choice

16:58.030 --> 17:00.230
but to confess to being the mastermind.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.360
I heard

17:02.440 --> 17:05.349
Yan Rui has the Criminal Justice Office
at his disposal.

17:05.349 --> 17:07.150
If they don't torture you today,

17:07.310 --> 17:09.640
they certainly won't spare you tomorrow.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.640
If you want to spare yourself

17:12.829 --> 17:14.290
some physical suffering,

17:14.829 --> 17:16.480
sign the confession first.

17:18.550 --> 17:20.010
Once your father returns,

17:20.160 --> 17:22.420
I'll definitely find a way to get you out.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.480
Good nephew,

17:31.590 --> 17:32.920
when the time comes,

17:33.550 --> 17:35.880
just say you got into a dispute
with Guo Baofeng

17:35.880 --> 17:37.440
and killed him by accident.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.680
Lord Wei, what a refined pastime,

17:46.960 --> 17:48.830
helping him cook up a story
in the dead of night.

17:48.830 --> 17:50.070
Why don't you say it out loud

17:50.070 --> 17:51.510
so we can hear it too?

17:53.510 --> 17:54.310
You really are

17:54.590 --> 17:56.350
Lord Yan's right-hand men.

17:56.960 --> 17:59.440
Even this late at night, you're still
diligently performing your duties.

17:59.440 --> 18:01.590
I'm concerned about the case,

18:01.960 --> 18:02.960
so I came especially to see the suspect

18:02.960 --> 18:04.830
and persuade him to
turn back before it's too late.

18:04.830 --> 18:05.430
Is that so?

18:05.680 --> 18:08.540
I thought perhaps you meant to
use this opportunity

18:08.590 --> 18:11.250
to let Second Young Master Xie
be the scapegoat.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.860
A prison is no ordinary place.

18:15.640 --> 18:17.400
If some taboo is violated

18:17.400 --> 18:18.400
and blood is shed,

18:18.880 --> 18:19.960
it won't end well.

18:20.270 --> 18:21.870
Lord Wei, you should go back.

18:22.510 --> 18:23.310
Alright then.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.720
Good nephew.

18:29.070 --> 18:30.600
Take good care of yourself.

18:51.270 --> 18:51.960
Mother.

18:55.030 --> 18:57.400
Those armed guards outside

18:57.960 --> 18:59.680
have switched shifts several times.

18:59.680 --> 19:01.270
What should we do?

19:01.550 --> 19:02.440
Why panic?

19:02.960 --> 19:04.440
Back in the day, my husband

19:04.720 --> 19:06.200
traveled far and wide.

19:06.680 --> 19:08.550
He'd seen it all.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.930
Since things have come to this,

19:11.880 --> 19:14.830
there will eventually
be a way to solve it.

19:16.000 --> 19:18.070
But the rumors outside

19:18.350 --> 19:20.010
are spreading like wildfire.

19:20.510 --> 19:22.680
People have mouths of their own.

19:23.110 --> 19:24.920
You can't stop people from

19:25.480 --> 19:27.000
talking behind your back.

19:27.350 --> 19:30.550
At worst, they'll get
a few more days of laughs at our expense.

19:30.550 --> 19:32.440
It won't do us any real harm.

19:33.110 --> 19:33.880
Yes.

19:36.960 --> 19:38.070
Qingyuan.

19:41.830 --> 19:43.750
Did you mix

19:44.310 --> 19:47.110
white sandalwood into today's hair oil?

19:47.510 --> 19:48.720
Yes, Grandmother.

19:49.240 --> 19:51.270
I also added 3 maces of biota seeds.

19:51.270 --> 19:52.510
They help calm the mind.

19:52.510 --> 19:54.200
So you'll be able to

19:54.200 --> 19:55.550
sleep better tonight.

19:56.480 --> 19:58.200
You're the filial one,

19:58.750 --> 20:00.920
unlike those disappointing ones

20:01.200 --> 20:03.030
who only cause me trouble.

20:05.640 --> 20:06.680
Old Madam?

20:09.830 --> 20:10.790
Old Madam!

20:13.200 --> 20:14.070
Old Madam!

20:16.880 --> 20:18.410
Qingyuan, you're here too.

20:18.440 --> 20:20.790
I've been muddled these past 2 days,

20:20.960 --> 20:22.030
and I didn't even

20:22.590 --> 20:24.160
come to pay my respects to you
after dinner.

20:24.160 --> 20:25.510
You've always been muddled,

20:25.510 --> 20:27.350
not just these 2 days.

20:27.720 --> 20:29.030
Your son

20:29.480 --> 20:31.310
has gotten us into such trouble.

20:32.000 --> 20:34.260
Your reprimand is justified, Old Madam.

20:37.070 --> 20:38.200
My dear Qingyuan,

20:38.480 --> 20:41.030
this time you must help me

20:42.200 --> 20:44.590
and also your second brother.

20:45.200 --> 20:46.240
He's always

20:46.350 --> 20:48.510
going on about you,

20:48.640 --> 20:51.550
telling everyone you have a kind heart.

20:51.920 --> 20:55.510
Surely you won't just
leave him to die this time?

20:55.960 --> 20:58.110
Old Madam, what do you think?

20:58.440 --> 20:59.510
This bracelet

20:59.510 --> 21:00.970
is nothing of great value.

21:01.000 --> 21:02.270
Second Madam is in charge of

21:02.270 --> 21:04.720
6 estates and 8 shops.

21:05.350 --> 21:08.150
Since she's sincerely offered you
this bracelet,

21:08.200 --> 21:09.350
just accept it.

21:10.440 --> 21:11.240
Right, right.

21:11.480 --> 21:13.440
Look how lovely it looks on you.

21:15.240 --> 21:16.270
I've long heard

21:16.270 --> 21:18.200
that you're a good manager
of the household,

21:18.200 --> 21:20.530
and today I've finally seen it for myself.

21:21.270 --> 21:23.530
It's just a pity that I'm not very bright.

21:23.720 --> 21:26.450
Otherwise, I'd certainly love to
learn from you.

21:28.550 --> 21:29.750
We're family.

21:30.070 --> 21:31.600
No need for such formality.

21:31.880 --> 21:33.400
Your cleverness

21:33.590 --> 21:35.520
is what caught the Old Madam's eye.

21:36.000 --> 21:37.000
You should learn.

21:37.400 --> 21:38.510
You need to learn from Second Madam

21:38.510 --> 21:40.000
and study hard

21:40.310 --> 21:43.440
so that you can be of some help
to the family in the future.

21:47.590 --> 21:48.240
Right.

21:48.640 --> 21:51.000
If you really want to learn,

21:51.070 --> 21:53.240
you may as well take over the pharmacy

21:53.590 --> 21:55.320
on South Street to practice on.

21:55.510 --> 21:57.200
It was going to

21:57.310 --> 21:58.910
be yours eventually anyway.

21:59.160 --> 22:00.000
That's great!

22:00.510 --> 22:01.590
Thank you, Second Madam.

22:01.590 --> 22:04.650
I certainly won't let your good intentions
go to waste.

22:08.960 --> 22:10.490
Since you're going to do it,

22:11.000 --> 22:12.510
do it well.

22:13.830 --> 22:14.640
Second Madam.

22:24.440 --> 22:25.200
Okay.

22:29.440 --> 22:30.770
Don't... Don't kill me!

22:30.880 --> 22:31.680
Don't kill me!

22:32.440 --> 22:33.920
Why would I kill you,

22:33.920 --> 22:35.110
Second Young Master Xie?

22:35.110 --> 22:37.000
I have my own uses for you.

22:37.480 --> 22:38.310
How do you feel?

22:38.310 --> 22:39.680
After being locked up for so long,

22:39.680 --> 22:40.540
are you thirsty

22:40.640 --> 22:42.570
or would you like something to eat?

22:43.070 --> 22:43.830
Come on,

22:44.350 --> 22:45.750
Second Young Master Xie.

22:46.400 --> 22:47.330
What do you want?

22:58.200 --> 22:59.480
What's this?

23:17.480 --> 23:18.540
Fresh watermelon.

23:21.920 --> 23:22.750
Have some.

23:35.480 --> 23:36.140
Is it sweet?

23:48.000 --> 23:48.960
Lord Yan,

23:50.790 --> 23:52.850
are you also trying to make me confess

23:53.000 --> 23:54.400
to being the mastermind?

23:56.240 --> 23:57.160
Also?

24:00.750 --> 24:02.920
I don't know who wants you to confess.

24:03.960 --> 24:06.400
But as it happens,
there's now some new evidence

24:06.400 --> 24:08.330
that can prove you didn't kill him.

24:09.480 --> 24:10.750
You? Being that kind?

24:12.640 --> 24:14.510
You'd be delighted if I died here.

24:14.920 --> 24:17.450
Zhengjun, how could you
think so poorly of me?

24:18.200 --> 24:20.720
I really want to help you clear your name.

24:21.110 --> 24:22.640
So I want you to

24:22.640 --> 24:25.970
tell me everything about
how you and Guo Baofeng conspired.

24:26.000 --> 24:28.130
That way, I can make a proper decision.

24:31.000 --> 24:31.830
Yes,

24:32.510 --> 24:33.510
I know.

24:34.350 --> 24:35.830
As for the other day,

24:36.680 --> 24:38.680
when I had you arrested at your home,

24:38.960 --> 24:40.510
I truly had no choice.

24:41.160 --> 24:43.400
I've been acting on His Majesty's orders.

24:43.400 --> 24:46.070
Naturally, I need to give His Majesty
an explanation, right?

24:46.070 --> 24:47.400
As long as you can help me find out

24:47.400 --> 24:49.600
who the real mastermind behind this is,

24:49.720 --> 24:51.120
I guarantee you'll live.

24:53.350 --> 24:54.200
You?

24:54.480 --> 24:55.830
You always lie.

24:56.550 --> 24:58.750
Last time, when you demanded
money and grain

24:58.750 --> 25:01.280
from my grandmother,
you said the same thing.

25:01.510 --> 25:02.840
This time is different.

25:03.110 --> 25:04.110
I give you my word.

25:04.480 --> 25:06.400
As long as you cooperate with us,

25:06.880 --> 25:07.960
I can set you free.

25:12.720 --> 25:13.480
Write.

25:21.160 --> 25:22.000
Quickly.

26:10.680 --> 26:11.590
Nice drawing.

26:16.200 --> 26:17.640
What a pity.

26:19.310 --> 26:21.550
The watermelon I dug out of the mass grave

26:21.550 --> 26:22.640
has gone to waste.

26:28.830 --> 26:29.690
Your Lordship,

26:30.160 --> 26:32.270
Xie Zhengjun drew a hen to mock you,

26:32.680 --> 26:34.610
and you're not the least bit angry?

26:34.880 --> 26:36.110
Why would I be?

26:36.440 --> 26:38.440
The one I was waiting for was never him,

26:38.440 --> 26:40.100
but the Xie family's rescuer.

26:41.200 --> 26:42.440
Rescuer?

26:43.370 --> 26:45.770
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

26:46.110 --> 26:47.200
By Lord Yan's order,

26:47.200 --> 26:48.750
no one may enter
or leave the Xie Residence.

26:48.750 --> 26:50.160
I'm the Heir of the Marquis of Danyang.

26:50.160 --> 26:51.620
How dare you try to stop me?

26:51.880 --> 26:52.540
Move aside!

26:53.790 --> 26:54.720
Young Master Li!

26:54.920 --> 26:55.680
Young Master Li!

26:55.680 --> 26:56.200
Out of my way!

26:55.850 --> 26:57.390
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

26:59.720 --> 27:01.050
I have something to say!

27:01.240 --> 27:02.110
Young Master Li!

27:02.110 --> 27:03.590
Young Master Li,
please don't make things difficult for us.

27:03.590 --> 27:04.480
I'm here to propose marriage,

27:04.480 --> 27:05.110
not to break anyone out of prison.

27:05.110 --> 27:05.880
Young Master Li!

27:05.880 --> 27:07.210
Why are you stopping me?

27:11.790 --> 27:12.720
Old Madam Xie.

27:13.110 --> 27:14.040
Young Master Li,

27:15.030 --> 27:17.000
why have you come?

27:22.070 --> 27:23.400
I, Li Congxin, have come

27:23.750 --> 27:25.160
to offer Eastern Pearls as betrothal gifts

27:25.160 --> 27:27.960
and ask for the hand of a daughter
of the Xie family.

27:29.960 --> 27:30.790
Good child,

27:31.350 --> 27:33.150
we all know what's in your heart.

27:33.640 --> 27:34.720
Our Qingru

27:35.070 --> 27:36.240
has also been hoping day and night

27:36.240 --> 27:37.590
to tie the knot with you.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.920
But the timing right now...

27:39.920 --> 27:41.320
Madam, you're mistaken.

27:42.400 --> 27:43.600
The one I want to marry

27:43.640 --> 27:46.370
is the fourth daughter
of your family, Qingyuan.

28:12.830 --> 28:13.920
Chunzhi,

28:15.160 --> 28:16.090
what did you say?

28:34.440 --> 28:35.240
My Lady!

28:44.640 --> 28:45.640
Young Master Li,

28:46.480 --> 28:49.340
do you know the situation
our family is in right now?

28:53.920 --> 28:55.580
That's exactly why I've come.

28:55.830 --> 28:57.090
And you're not afraid?

28:57.440 --> 28:58.640
What is there to fear?

28:58.920 --> 29:00.160
If I marry Qingyuan,

29:00.550 --> 29:02.070
I'll protect her with my life

29:02.070 --> 29:04.670
and won't let anyone harm her
in the slightest.

29:04.880 --> 29:06.480
And as for her maternal family,

29:06.480 --> 29:08.810
I'll definitely take care of them as well.

29:09.480 --> 29:10.310
Old Madam,

29:10.750 --> 29:13.150
he's the only son
of the Marquis of Danyang.

29:13.480 --> 29:14.830
If she marries him,

29:15.070 --> 29:16.400
it would be marrying up.

29:16.550 --> 29:17.920
It'd save her from being tied to those...

29:17.920 --> 29:20.180
The Xie Residence is quite lively today.

29:20.680 --> 29:21.400
What?

29:21.960 --> 29:24.020
What brings the Marquis of Danyang's

29:24.550 --> 29:26.110
precious only son here uninvited?

29:26.110 --> 29:27.880
Is there something you want to negotiate?

29:27.880 --> 29:28.410
Exactly.

29:29.440 --> 29:33.240
I've come to ask for the hand of
the fourth daughter of the Xie family.

29:34.000 --> 29:35.800
The items are quite impressive.

29:36.030 --> 29:37.960
I just don't know if Fourth Lady Xie

29:38.030 --> 29:39.360
prefers Eastern Pearls

29:40.270 --> 29:41.000
or jade.

29:48.440 --> 29:49.240
Qingyuan,

29:50.480 --> 29:51.960
what do you say?

29:56.030 --> 29:57.590
"Marriage is decided by the parents

29:57.590 --> 29:59.070
and arranged by a matchmaker."

29:59.070 --> 30:00.720
Now that Father isn't at home,

30:00.720 --> 30:04.380
I'll naturally leave the decision
entirely to you, Grandmother.

30:11.640 --> 30:13.100
Marriage is a major event.

30:13.480 --> 30:15.010
It cannot be taken lightly.

30:15.440 --> 30:17.240
Even if Qingyuan agrees,

30:18.000 --> 30:18.920
it must still be

30:19.590 --> 30:22.000
approved by the elders of the families.

30:23.160 --> 30:25.290
Old Madam, does that mean you consent?

30:25.920 --> 30:26.320
Great.

30:27.000 --> 30:27.860
I'll go home now

30:28.030 --> 30:29.290
and inform my parents.

30:29.640 --> 30:30.240
Qingyuan,

30:30.830 --> 30:32.160
keep these safe for now.

30:32.310 --> 30:32.970
Wait for me!

30:33.720 --> 30:34.650
Young Master Li!

30:38.000 --> 30:39.530
Fourth Lady Xie, looks like

30:39.920 --> 30:42.320
you only like Eastern Pearls,
but not jade.

30:43.880 --> 30:44.480
Lord Yan!

30:44.480 --> 30:45.000
Leave!

30:47.310 --> 30:48.840
You may all go back and rest.

30:50.440 --> 30:51.030
I

30:51.750 --> 30:54.010
have something to say to Fourth Lady Xie.

30:58.960 --> 30:59.880
Wenzhuo,

31:00.680 --> 31:02.680
help me back so I can copy the sutras.

31:36.510 --> 31:37.790
You useless wretch!

31:38.200 --> 31:39.350
You useless wretch!

31:39.350 --> 31:41.110
Father, please stop whipping him!

31:41.110 --> 31:42.710
I was the one who sneaked out!

31:43.350 --> 31:45.240
You've pulled your back. Stop then.

31:45.240 --> 31:47.100
You've already pulled your back.

31:47.680 --> 31:48.410
Are you okay?

31:51.680 --> 31:52.310
Father.

31:53.000 --> 31:54.600
I was the one who sneaked out.

31:54.720 --> 31:56.030
Please don't punish him.

31:56.030 --> 31:57.440
You wretch!

31:58.920 --> 32:00.680
I ordered you again and again

32:01.240 --> 32:03.700
not to let Young Master
out of the courtyard!

32:04.640 --> 32:05.960
Why didn't you listen?

32:07.110 --> 32:08.640
And now look what happened.

32:08.960 --> 32:11.420
He went to the Xie family
and embarrassed me!

32:12.270 --> 32:13.130
Your Lordship,

32:13.200 --> 32:14.000
I was wrong.

32:14.000 --> 32:15.260
I'll never do it again.

32:15.550 --> 32:17.310
I'm going to marry Xie Qingyuan,
no matter what.

32:17.310 --> 32:19.510
-M-Marry...
-If you won't allow it,

32:19.680 --> 32:21.680
you might as well beat me to death.

32:24.830 --> 32:27.030
You truly are a lovesick fool.

32:28.200 --> 32:29.880
You really think that Xie girl

32:30.160 --> 32:32.490
is some gentle and understanding beauty?

32:33.000 --> 32:36.750
She's the boning knife in Yan Rui's hands!

32:36.920 --> 32:38.070
Once you get involved with her,

32:38.070 --> 32:40.070
you won't even know how you died!

32:40.640 --> 32:43.040
Qingyuan would never collude with Yan Rui.

32:43.110 --> 32:43.720
Anyway,

32:44.160 --> 32:45.760
I won't marry anyone but her.

32:45.880 --> 32:46.940
If you don't agree,

32:47.440 --> 32:49.040
I'll starve myself to death!

32:50.480 --> 32:51.160
Fine!

32:51.590 --> 32:52.510
Starve yourself to death!

32:52.510 --> 32:54.910
I'll simply pretend
I never had a son at all!

32:55.510 --> 32:56.240
Si!

32:57.510 --> 32:59.240
Keep an eye on Young Master.

32:59.920 --> 33:01.650
Lock him in the rear courtyard.

33:01.920 --> 33:04.350
Don't let him
step out of the residence again.

33:04.350 --> 33:06.310
If he gets out again,

33:07.240 --> 33:09.100
I'll break those legs of yours...

33:12.790 --> 33:13.240
You...

33:15.160 --> 33:15.880
Get out!

33:35.510 --> 33:36.370
Second Sister,

33:37.400 --> 33:38.400
are you okay?

33:40.270 --> 33:42.130
Tell me, what kind of dirty tricks

33:42.270 --> 33:44.440
did that woman use

33:46.070 --> 33:48.550
to bewitch Chunzhi so completely?

33:50.030 --> 33:51.160
I don't know either.

33:52.070 --> 33:53.470
Probably the same tricks

33:53.750 --> 33:55.480
she's been using on Lord Yan.

33:56.310 --> 33:57.720
Pretending to be innocent and harmless,

33:57.720 --> 33:59.380
but actually full of schemes.

33:59.830 --> 34:01.090
Just now, I even saw her

34:01.240 --> 34:02.350
in the hallway,

34:03.400 --> 34:05.200
pulling and tugging at Lord Yan.

34:15.400 --> 34:16.360
Xie Qingyuan,

34:16.920 --> 34:18.920
I've been following you for so long,

34:19.190 --> 34:20.920
yet I've gotten zero response.

34:21.800 --> 34:24.190
Do you really think I'm your watchdog?

34:25.710 --> 34:26.510
Let me ask you.

34:27.960 --> 34:30.360
Were you sincere
when you told Old Madam Xie

34:31.150 --> 34:33.480
that your marriage was up to your parents?

34:33.510 --> 34:35.639
Since you know I'm a puppet on strings,

34:35.960 --> 34:37.760
why bother caring

34:38.110 --> 34:39.710
whose hand holds my strings?

34:41.800 --> 34:44.590
In any case,
it certainly won't be your hand.

34:53.280 --> 34:54.230
Xie Qingyuan!

34:54.550 --> 34:56.989
I'll show you what's what today!

34:59.360 --> 35:00.230
What?

35:00.920 --> 35:02.890
Second Lady Xie, now it's your turn

35:03.000 --> 35:04.460
to beat up your own family?

35:04.480 --> 35:06.210
Your family is so interesting.

35:06.630 --> 35:07.480
Lord Yan,

35:08.190 --> 35:10.320
you never turn a blind eye to anything.

35:10.480 --> 35:11.270
But today,

35:11.480 --> 35:13.110
you can tolerate Xie Qingyuan

35:13.110 --> 35:15.640
pining for another man
right under your nose?

35:16.710 --> 35:18.110
I'd actually like to hear

35:18.880 --> 35:21.010
how she's been pining for another man.

35:21.400 --> 35:23.860
She's been coveting Chunzhi
for a long time.

35:23.860 --> 35:25.570
She secretly approached him

35:26.000 --> 35:27.530
and even shamelessly

35:27.670 --> 35:29.320
hid the jade pendant

35:29.320 --> 35:30.530
Chunzhi gave me.

35:32.110 --> 35:33.320
I saw it with my own eyes.

35:33.320 --> 35:35.110
It was I who helped
get the jade pendant back.

35:35.110 --> 35:36.370
It's absolutely true!

35:41.150 --> 35:43.480
Who did you say
this jade pendant was from?

35:44.840 --> 35:45.370
It was...

35:46.400 --> 35:49.200
It was Young Master Li
who gave it to Second Sister.

35:52.440 --> 35:54.510
You stole it from Xie Qingyuan.

35:55.630 --> 35:56.440
I didn't!

36:05.110 --> 36:07.370
Then it was you
who treated what I gave you

36:07.880 --> 36:09.200
as a mere toy.

36:11.070 --> 36:12.920
Second Sister, since you like it,

36:12.920 --> 36:13.840
you can have it.

36:17.800 --> 36:18.670
In that case,

36:18.960 --> 36:21.800
why don't you take the bracelet
Second Madam gave me

36:21.800 --> 36:22.760
as well?

36:24.550 --> 36:26.350
Either way, they're just things

36:27.320 --> 36:28.850
others forced me to accept.

36:50.330 --> 36:54.510
[Harmony Among Kin]

36:55.400 --> 36:57.130
You still have the nerve to cry?

36:57.510 --> 36:59.240
Look at the situation we're in.

36:59.320 --> 37:00.840
Why did you mess with her?

37:01.150 --> 37:04.010
-Xie Qingyuan set Second Sister up first!
-Enough!

37:06.110 --> 37:07.970
I truly thought that jade pendant

37:08.110 --> 37:09.590
was from Chunzhi.

37:10.550 --> 37:11.680
Who could have known

37:12.320 --> 37:15.320
it was a token
of her illicit affair with Yan Rui!

37:17.710 --> 37:18.710
Not another word.

37:28.480 --> 37:30.610
You're confined to your room for 3 days

37:30.960 --> 37:33.160
and must copy the Heart Sutra 100 times.

37:33.880 --> 37:34.550
Yes.

37:39.190 --> 37:40.120
Grandmother...

37:52.800 --> 37:53.670
You...

37:55.400 --> 37:57.360
[Danyue Pavilion]

37:59.860 --> 38:02.520
[Qinyue Corridor]

38:00.240 --> 38:07.140
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

38:03.070 --> 38:05.130
didn't stand here all night, did you?

38:07.160 --> 38:13.640
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

38:07.670 --> 38:08.840
As for that jade pendant,

38:08.840 --> 38:11.190
Grandmother has already punished
Second Sister and Third Sister.

38:11.190 --> 38:13.440
Your Lordship isn't still angry, are you?

38:13.440 --> 38:14.030
No.

38:13.740 --> 38:21.380
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

38:15.360 --> 38:17.290
Then what does Your Lordship want?

38:18.880 --> 38:19.960
Woman,

38:20.400 --> 38:22.030
is your heart really made of cold iron?

38:21.500 --> 38:28.800
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

38:22.670 --> 38:24.280
Your grandmother punished your two sisters

38:24.280 --> 38:25.670
to appease me.

38:25.880 --> 38:26.670
And you,

38:27.110 --> 38:28.440
the main culprit.

38:28.950 --> 38:35.870
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

38:31.110 --> 38:34.440
Yet you could sleep soundly until dawn,
completely at ease.

38:34.670 --> 38:35.960
Aren't you afraid I'll

38:35.960 --> 38:44.840
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

38:36.880 --> 38:37.960
have your entire household

38:37.960 --> 38:39.030
arrested?

38:39.510 --> 38:40.320
Would you?

38:51.440 --> 38:52.550
Yan,

38:53.070 --> 38:53.920
hurry up.

38:54.920 --> 38:57.150
Drink this bowl of hot ginger soup.

38:57.150 --> 38:58.710
You must've caught a cold.

38:59.630 --> 39:00.550
And you!

39:00.550 --> 39:01.190
Seriously,

39:01.190 --> 39:03.960
it's so cold in the morning,
and you dress so lightly.

39:03.960 --> 39:06.110
-What if you catch a cold?
-Granny, I'm fine.

39:06.110 --> 39:06.840
I'm not cold.

39:22.480 --> 39:23.190
Drink it.

39:25.110 --> 39:27.440
Don't you think you owe me an explanation?

39:28.880 --> 39:29.740
Your Lordship,

39:29.800 --> 39:36.700
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

39:30.030 --> 39:32.000
I'm a person with a mind of my own.

39:32.550 --> 39:33.630
Whether I like something

39:33.630 --> 39:35.110
or dislike it,

39:35.480 --> 39:36.630
it's my right.

39:36.730 --> 39:43.210
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

39:36.880 --> 39:38.810
I don't owe anyone an explanation.

39:43.150 --> 39:44.760
Even if you didn't want it,

39:43.310 --> 39:50.950
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

39:45.710 --> 39:48.570
you shouldn't have
given it to someone else, right?

39:50.550 --> 39:51.880
I originally wanted to throw it away.

39:51.070 --> 39:58.370
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

39:52.480 --> 39:53.800
But her taking it

39:53.800 --> 39:54.860
seems no different

39:55.190 --> 39:56.590
from throwing it away.

39:58.510 --> 40:05.440
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

40:00.400 --> 40:01.280
Xie Qingyuan,

40:02.550 --> 40:04.210
do you really have to anger me?

40:05.530 --> 40:16.010
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

40:08.230 --> 40:09.070
No.

40:09.920 --> 40:11.650
It's just that, at that moment,

40:12.070 --> 40:14.670
I truly felt I had no need
for that jade pendant.

40:16.430 --> 40:23.440
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

40:23.470 --> 40:30.470
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

40:29.320 --> 40:30.500
Listen carefully then.

40:30.500 --> 40:33.990
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

40:32.320 --> 40:33.320
You'll need it.

40:34.020 --> 40:37.680
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

40:37.710 --> 40:43.740
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

40:45.960 --> 40:46.820
Your Lordship!

40:50.360 --> 40:51.220
Your Lordship.

40:51.320 --> 40:52.380
Xie Shu's carriage

40:52.710 --> 40:53.510
has entered the city.
